{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HSoW1rmMEr8TTCu6ECVgse","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/xling_calib_direction/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# xling_calib_direction — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-20 20:18 UTC | 更新原因: Reviewer feedback integrated: D12 grid justification, D16 mean-shift formalization, CaCLR Path B geometric theory, per-language rho, CKA pilot\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nCross-lingual correctness probe transfer reveals architecture-dependent Pareto frontier (depth vs transferability). CaCLR tests distributional matching; CKA provides mechanistic explanation. Mean-shift rank-invariance proof as formal theoretical contribution. 详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research phase** — MVP 通过 (D004)，Dream 审稿处理完成 (D005)，Reviewer 反馈已整合。等待 re-dream 验证后批准 P0。\\\\n\\\\n## Dream 审稿处理总结\\\\n- 初审评分: best=4/6, median=3/6, worst=3/6 (weak reject)\\\\n- 13+2 条确认行动项已执行（Reviewer 补充 D12 grid 理由 + D16 mean-shift 形式化）\\\\n- CaCLR framing 改为 conditional narrative（Path A method / Path B negative result with geometric explanation）\\\\n- 新增 3 P1 实验: plan_011 (CKA), plan_012 (linproj sensitivity), plan_013 (probing controls)\\\\n- 全局统计检验要求 + per-language Pareto rho + threshold sensitivity\\\\n- 5 条观察项待真实实验\\\\n\\\\n## 紧急事项\\\\n- ⚠️ Temperature scaling T=6.21 数据划分未确认 — Agent 正在检查（data integrity 风险）\\\\n- Agent 同时跑 CKA pilot（MVP activations，验证 plan_011 pipeline）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] Agent 确认 temp scaling 数据划分 + CKA pilot 结果\\\\n- [ ] 确认 mvp_003 (Llama-3.1-8B) 结果\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream 验证 framing/plan 改动（目标: best ≥ weak accept, median ≥ borderline）\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream 达标后批准 plan_001 + plan_002（P0，可 4 GPU 并行）\\\\n- [ ] [Dream 观察] O1: plan_002 Llama4 Pareto rho\\\\n- [ ] [Dream 观察] O3: plan_003 CaCLR consistency loss\\\\n- [ ] [Dream 观察] O4: plan_005 orthogonality 贡献度\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: 4× RTX 6000 PRO 96GB (westd-13176)\\\\n- P0: ~155 GPU-hrs | P1: ~39 GPU-hrs (含 Dream 新增 9h) | P2: ~80 GPU-hrs\\\\n- MVP 已用: ~7 GPU-hrs\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划\\\\n详见 experiment_plan.yaml。P0: 4 (plan_001-004)。P1: 7 (plan_005-013)。P2: 2 (plan_008-009)。\\\\nCross-cutting: bootstrap CI + paired test + Cohen's d + AUROC threshold sensitivity + per-language rho。\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-20 | Clarify P1 criterion: mvp_003 is 2/4 PASS (not 3/4 | mvp_003, mvp_001 |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-20 | mvp_003 (Llama-3.1-8B) cross-architecture validati | mvp_003, mvp_001 |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-20 | MVP gate re-evaluation after P1 leakage fix: 2/4 P | mvp_001, plan_003 |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-20 | Dream review (3/6 weak reject) processed: 13 confi | plan_003, plan_011, plan_012, plan_013 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-20 | MVP gate: 3/4 PASS，核心假设获充分支持，进入 research 阶段 | mvp_001 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-20 | P4 criterion 从 ΔAUROC ≥ 2pp 改为 ΔECE ≤ -2pp for ≥3/ | mvp_001 |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-20 | MVP 模型固定为 Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-20 | MVP 用 7-8B 模型验证核心假设，不直接上 235B | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2633, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RPuuTopp6NnUsTvKpmDsVo","session_id":"effd200a-63e4-4db3-aa5b-047288d9466f","uuid":"f189fccd-cac3-4f4f-a177-d17885e91d06","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:13:30.480Z"}
